{"id":795,"slug":"kicking-and-screaming","title":"Kicking and Screaming","year":1995,"country":"United States","duration":96,"spine":349,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/795-kicking-and-screaming","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/72a04d992e6b3851090778c7eca1c196/xhuxNVYn3OOfBFuHkk88LeeZQBlymM_large.jpg","description":"Paralyzed by postgraduation ennui, a group of college friends remain on campus, patching together a community for themselves in order to deny the real-world futures awaiting them. Academy Award–nominated screenwriter Noah Baumbach’s hilarious and touching directorial debut was one of the highlights of the American independent film scene of the nineties, speaking directly to a generation of adults-to-be unable to reconcile their hermetic educational experience with workaday responsibility, and posing the eternal question, where do we go from here? Stingingly funny and incisive, Baumbach’s breakthrough features endlessly quotable dialogue, delivered by a stellar ensemble cast. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Noah Baumbach","slug":"noah-baumbach"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Josh Hamilton","role":"Grover","slug":"josh-hamilton"},{"actor":"Olivia d'Abo","role":"Jane","slug":"olivia-d-abo"},{"actor":"Christopher Eigeman","role":"Max","slug":"christopher-eigeman"},{"actor":"Parker Posey","role":"Miami","slug":"parker-posey"},{"actor":"Carlos Jacott","role":"Otis","slug":"carlos-jacott"},{"actor":"Jason Wiles","role":"Skippy","slug":"jason-wiles"},{"actor":"Cara Buono","role":"Kate","slug":"cara-buono"},{"actor":"Elliott Gould","role":"Grover's dad","slug":"elliott-gould"},{"actor":"Eric Stoltz","role":"Chet","slug":"eric-stoltz"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Noah Baumbach","slug":"noah-baumbach"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Noah Baumbach","slug":"noah-baumbach"},{"role":"Producer","person":"Joel Castleberg","slug":null},{"role":"Executive producers","person":"Mark Amin","slug":null},{"role":"Executive pr